{{Short description|Administrative entry restrictions}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=January 2020}}
[[File:Passport front cover BHR.png|thumb|A [[Bahraini passport]]]]
'''[[Bahraini passport|Visa]] requirements for Bahraini citizens''' are administrative entry restrictions by the authorities of other states placed on citizens of [[Bahrain]]. As of  2026, Bahraini citizens had visa-free or visa on arrival access to 87 countries and territories, ranking the Bahraini passport 51st in the world according to the  [[Henley Passport Index]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Henley Passport Index |url=https://www.henleyglobal.com/passport-index/ranking}}</ref>

